&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Vancouver, WA &ndash; ESD 112&rsquo;s Prevent Coalition proudly announces this year&rsquo;s&amp;nbsp;Prevention Training Scholarship&amp;nbsp;awardees,&amp;nbsp;granting&amp;nbsp;14&amp;nbsp;rural community leaders&amp;nbsp;across Washington&amp;nbsp;funding to&amp;nbsp;attend crucial training in&amp;nbsp;mental health and substance use prevention education&amp;nbsp;and cover certification fees for prevention credentialing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

