&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;We believe every community deserves access to the tools and training necessary to create a safe, healthy environment for youth,&rdquo; said&amp;nbsp;Joy Lyons, Director of Prevention at ESD 112. &ldquo;These scholarships break down geographic and financial barriers, empowering local leaders to make meaningful, lasting change.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

