&lt;div style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center;"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align:left"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Gresham:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:left"&gt;Gresham is a vibrant and growing city where tradition blends seamlessly with innovation and opportunity. As Oregon's fourth-largest city, our community is built on a foundation of hard work, deep roots in agriculture, and a shared commitment to creating a thriving future. Discover more about what makes Gresham special by visiting&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="http://www.greshamoregon.gov/"&gt;GreshamOregon.gov&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

