     &lt;li&gt;Agency Budget Discussion &ndash; Board direction&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Don Lindley Property Discussion -Informational&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Boating Safety Section &ndash; Program updates&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Ana Reservoir Petition &ndash; Consideration for slow&ndash;no wake zone and potential rulemaking&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Upper Rogue River &ndash; Informational briefing&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Waterway Access Permit &ndash; Whitewater exemption, OAR 250-010-0760, board vote&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Siletz River Proposed Rulemaking &ndash; Board direction&lt;/li&gt;
