&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Public comments will be accepted in writing or during the meeting&rsquo;s public comment period. To provide oral testimony, register by 5 p.m., January 25, with Jennifer Cooper at &lt;a href="mailto:jennifer.cooper@boat.oregon.gov"&gt;jennifer.cooper@boat.oregon.gov&lt;/a&gt; or by mail: Oregon State Marine Board, Attn: Jennifer Cooper, 435 Commercial St. NE, Suite 400, Salem, OR 97301.&lt;/p&gt;

