&lt;p&gt;On January 21, 2026, detectives with the Battle Ground Police Department arrested Christopher Lee Morrissey (41) on suspicion of Rape of a Child in the Third Degree. The arrest stems from an investigation that began in 2022 involving a 14-year-old victim.&amp;nbsp; Morrissey was booked into the Clark County Jail.&lt;/p&gt;

