&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;The arrest stems from an incident on January 16, 2026, when victims reported being menaced with a firearm during a road rage encounter near Sunnyside Road and Boone Road SE. According to the victims, Muniz repeatedly rammed their vehicle with his white Toyota Tundra before stopping, breaking the driver&rsquo;s window with an AR&amp;nbsp;style carbine&amp;nbsp;rifle, and pointing the weapon at them while demanding money. The victims drove away and contacted police.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
