&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Marseille was lodged at Marion County Jail on multiple charges, including Felon in Possession of a Firearm, Unlawful Use of a Weapon, Menacing, and Unlawful Delivery&amp;nbsp;of Cocaine.&amp;nbsp;Juarez-Juarez&amp;nbsp;was lodged at Marion County Jail on multiple charges, including DUII,&amp;nbsp;Attempt&amp;nbsp;to Elude&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;Police Officer, and Reckless Driving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
